      "section_id": "trainingmobileappdevelopment_02_detail_section",
      "section_order": 2,
      "html_id": null,
      "element": "section",
      "section_name": "Detail Section",
      "section_heading": "Practical learning. A clearer next step.",
      "heading_level": "h2",
      "eyebrow": "The program",
      "subheading": "",
      "description": "Companies usually come to us with one of two problems: they have web developers who need to pick up mobile, or they have a Flutter or native app that only one person on the team really understands. Either way, the fix is the same: get more people comfortable in the codebase.\n\nWe split time between native Android (Java and Kotlin) and Flutter, so your team leaves knowing which approach actually fits a given project instead of defaulting to whatever was used last time.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The program",
